<title>USA: U.S. Robotics unveils router products.</title>
<headline>U.S. Robotics unveils router products.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Robotics Corp on Friday unveiled two new router products, which provide connections to corporate networks and the Internet.</p>
<p>The LANLinker 56 (Local Area Network) and LANLinker BRI help telecommuters, home users and other small LAN-based users access any program or file on a corporate network and access the Internet, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
